    m_Localized: Copper acorn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205317
    m_Localized: Beacon brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205318
    m_Localized: Yours
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205319
    m_Localized: Next trophy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205320
    m_Localized: Choose this trophy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205321
    m_Localized: Find in shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205322
    m_Localized: Choose a trophy to take with Mika.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205323
    m_Localized: Wear it on the map. No puzzle advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205324
    m_Localized: Makes one safe move for you. Uses wood normally. Once per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205325
    m_Localized: Shows the exact next landing before you descend. No pieces move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205326
    m_Localized: One safe move. Normal wood cost. Once per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205327
    m_Localized: Preview the next landing. Pieces stay put until Descend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205328
    m_Localized: Next landing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205329
    m_Localized: This is the last board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205330
    m_Localized: This landing would lose the row. Try another move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205331
    m_Localized: The row is ready. You can bring it home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205332
    m_Localized: This is where the pieces will land. Keep arranging below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205333
    m_Localized: Keep playing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 557615414239232
    m_Localized: One safe step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 557615418433536
    m_Localized: 'Trophies collected: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 557763439616000
    m_Localized: Added to your collection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 561463100956672
    m_Localized: 'Tools left: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 561463105150976
    m_Localized: 'Tools: up to 2 stars.

      No clean record.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 561463105150977
    m_Localized: The row would arrive home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 561463105150978
    m_Localized: The row will match the target on the next board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 564361234997248
    m_Localized: "World complete \xB7 {0}/{0} levels"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 564361239191552
    m_Localized: "Next world in {0} level \xB7 {1}/{2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 564361239191553
    m_Localized: "Next world in {0} levels \xB7 {1}/{2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 566306465112064
    m_Localized: "You are here \xB7 {0}/{1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283319615488
    m_Localized: Brilliant!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809792
    m_Localized: Beautifully done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809793
    m_Localized: Delivered!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809794
    m_Localized: Made it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809795
    m_Localized: A perfect, swift route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809796
    m_Localized: Aim for fewer moves and undos.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809797
    m_Localized: Moves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809798
    m_Localized: Undos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809799
    m_Localized: Time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584621170352128
    m_Localized: Your stars and score are saved for this mode.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057918808064
    m_Localized: Bram
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196672
    m_Localized: Sora
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196673
    m_Localized: Neri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196674
    m_Localized: Toma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196675
    m_Localized: Lumi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196676
    m_Localized: Gran
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196677
    m_Localized: Not now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196678
    m_Localized: Next line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196679
    m_Localized: Back to the map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196680
    m_Localized: Bram here. The storm broke our bridges. I can mend the wood if you
      bring back the lights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196681
    m_Localized: I am Pip. Our mill has stopped. Without it, the village has no water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196682
    m_Localized: I am Rue. My lantern trees went dark. Even the birds cannot find
      their nests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196683
    m_Localized: Sora, sky post! Well... ground post today. The wind scattered all
      our letters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196684
    m_Localized: I am Neri. The pond lamps went out. My little boats cannot find
      the shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196685
    m_Localized: Toma. I keep the maps. The storm hid the road to the beacon between
      these shelves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196686
    m_Localized: I am Lumi. I know the snow road. We will follow the warm lights
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196687
    m_Localized: Mika! There you are. The beacon is dark, but I kept a little light
      for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196688
    m_Localized: I am Mika. I am taking a light to Gran at the Great Beacon. Let
      us start here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196689
    m_Localized: We will get it turning. I would like to hear the water again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196690
    m_Localized: Let us light one tree first. Then the birds can show us the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196691
    m_Localized: One of those letters is for Gran. Let us find it together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196692
    m_Localized: I can help with the lamps. I will stay close to the shore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196693
    m_Localized: We have come so far. Let us find the last part of the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196694
    m_Localized: My paws are cold, but my lantern is still warm. Lead the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196695
    m_Localized: I kept mine too, Gran. Let us bring them home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196696
    m_Localized: Light the cloud market
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196697
    m_Localized: Reach Pip's mill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196698
    m_Localized: Start the mill wheel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196699
    m_Localized: Fill the little wells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196700
    m_Localized: Reach Rue's orchard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196701
    m_Localized: Light the lantern trees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196702
    m_Localized: Mend the branch bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196703
    m_Localized: Open the orchard path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196704
    m_Localized: Light the seed house
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196705
    m_Localized: Reach the sky post
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196706
    m_Localized: Find the lost letters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196707
    m_Localized: Mend the mail bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196708
    m_Localized: Reach the glass lagoon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196709
    m_Localized: Wake the pond lamps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196710
    m_Localized: Open the water gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196711
    m_Localized: Find Toma's archive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196712
    m_Localized: The first bridge is lit. I can see my workshop again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196713
    m_Localized: And I can see the next step. That feels less scary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196714
    m_Localized: The wind gate is open. Hold your scarf, Mika.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196715
    m_Localized: I am holding it! Now we can reach the sky lift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196716
    m_Localized: That lift has not moved since the storm. You did it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390976
    m_Localized: We did it. Your new boards held me up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390977
    m_Localized: The market lamps are back. I missed the smell of warm bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390978
    m_Localized: Let us save a loaf for Pip. He has been waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390979
    m_Localized: The road to the mill is safe. I will keep these bridges lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390980
    m_Localized: Thank you, Bram. When the beacon shines, you will see it from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390981
    m_Localized: Listen! The wheel is turning again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390982
    m_Localized: It sounds like the village waking up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390983
    m_Localized: Water is on its way to every little house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390984
    m_Localized: Now nobody has to carry it all that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390985
    m_Localized: The wells are full. Even my smallest bucket can reach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390986
    m_Localized: Then your little brother can help too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390987
    m_Localized: The post boat floats again. There is a letter for your gran aboard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390988
    m_Localized: I will make sure it gets there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390989
    m_Localized: Rue is waiting beyond the orchard gate. Tell her the mill is all
      right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390990
    m_Localized: I will. Keep a cup of tea for our way back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390991
    m_Localized: The lantern trees are glowing. Look, the birds found their nests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390992
    m_Localized: They are singing louder than my lantern can shine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390993
    m_Localized: The branch bridge is steady now. No more wobbling baskets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390994
    m_Localized: Good. I nearly dropped Gran's letter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390995
    m_Localized: The path is open. I can send jam to the village again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390996
    m_Localized: Gran will ask for the recipe. She always does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390997
    m_Localized: The seeds are safe and warm. Soon there will be new trees.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390998
    m_Localized: Little lights for the next travellers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390999
    m_Localized: Follow that red scarf. Sora will take you to the sky post.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391000
    m_Localized: Another friend on the road. I like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391001
    m_Localized: The letters are all together. Not one left in a cloud!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391002
    m_Localized: That small one is Gran's. Please keep it dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391003
    m_Localized: Your letter is on its way. I put it in my safest bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391004
    m_Localized: Now she will know I am coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391005
    m_Localized: This bridge connects the whole post route again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391006
    m_Localized: So everyone can hear from their friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391007
    m_Localized: The basket is up! I should write a letter too. I just never know
      how to start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391008
    m_Localized: 'Try: I missed you. That is a good start.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391009
    m_Localized: Neri is waiting by the lagoon. She makes boats out of leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391010
    m_Localized: I hope mine will have a very small sail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391011
    m_Localized: The pier is whole again. You can come closer, Mika.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057943973888
    m_Localized: Only a little. Deep water still makes my paws shake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057943973889
    m_Localized: Our lamps have little twins in the water. See?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057943973890
    m_Localized: Two lights from one. Gran would love this place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168192
    m_Localized: The water gate is open. The little boats can go home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168193
    m_Localized: The beacon is still dark. I hope Gran can see my letter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168194
    m_Localized: Your pond light is steady. Even the fish have come to look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168195
    m_Localized: They look like tiny stars swimming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168196
    m_Localized: Toma keeps a map of the snow road. His archive is just ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168197
    m_Localized: Thank you, Neri. I will come back when the lamps are all lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168198
    m_Localized: The leaf door is open. Please wipe your paws. The maps are old.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168199
    m_Localized: I will be careful. We need just one road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168200
    m_Localized: The shelves are free. I can reach my favourite book again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168201
    m_Localized: What is it about? I would like to read it with Gran.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168202
    m_Localized: Here is the storm map. The snow road leads straight to the beacon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168203
    m_Localized: It looks far on paper. We will take it one step at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168204
    m_Localized: The page is dry. Your scarf saved the ink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168205
    m_Localized: Gran knitted it. I think she knew I would need it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168206
    m_Localized: 'This note is from Gran: I am waiting. There is soup on the stove.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168207
    m_Localized: Then we had better not let it get cold. Where is Lumi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168208
    m_Localized: The snow steps are bright. Stay close to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362496
    m_Localized: I can follow them now, even in all this white.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362497
    m_Localized: The shelter is warm again. We can rest our paws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362498
    m_Localized: Just a moment. I want to tell Gran about everyone we met.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362499
    m_Localized: The frozen arch is behind us. You crossed it without looking down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362500
    m_Localized: I looked at your scarf instead. It helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362501
    m_Localized: Pip's blanket is still dry. He told me to make sure you stayed warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362502
    m_Localized: He remembered. I will bring it back with a thank-you note.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362503
    m_Localized: There is the beacon road. You can see Gran's window from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362504
    m_Localized: A light in her window! She really is waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362505
    m_Localized: The last bridge is lit. Come here, let me see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362506
    m_Localized: I brought stories, Gran. More than I can fit in one letter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362507
    m_Localized: The lantern lift is ready. Who helped you get this far?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362508
    m_Localized: Bram, Pip, Rue... so many friends. I wish they could see us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362509
    m_Localized: These stairs used to look so tall to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362510
    m_Localized: They still do. But now I know how to keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362511
    m_Localized: The sky lantern is up. Your little light made it all the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362512
    m_Localized: I was scared sometimes. The others stayed with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556800
    m_Localized: Look, Mika. The beacon is shining. Every island can see us now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556801
    m_Localized: Then let us wave to everyone. We made it home together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556802
    m_Localized: Your paws are shaking. We can take a breath before the next board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556803
    m_Localized: A breath, then a step. I can do that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556804
    m_Localized: That board held. My hammer and your patience make a good team.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556805
    m_Localized: Your hammer is much louder than my patience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556806
    m_Localized: I used to rush the wheel. It only splashed me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556807
    m_Localized: Let us look before we move this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751104
    m_Localized: Can you hear the mill from here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751105
    m_Localized: Yes. I like knowing it is still working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751106
    m_Localized: One branch at a time. That is how a tree grows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751107
    m_Localized: And one board at a time for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751108
    m_Localized: I think a bird is following your lantern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751109
    m_Localized: It can come. There is room for one more friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751110
    m_Localized: I can fly fast. Landing neatly is the hard part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751111
    m_Localized: Then we both have something to practise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751112
    m_Localized: 'This letter only says: Come for tea.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751113
    m_Localized: That is plenty. I would go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751114
    m_Localized: The pond is quiet today. We can hear ourselves think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751115
    m_Localized: I am thinking about that next board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945408
    m_Localized: My smallest boat always takes the longest way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945409
    m_Localized: Maybe it likes the view. I do too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945410
    m_Localized: We need the right order, just like books on a shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945411
    m_Localized: Then I will leave the silly book next to the scary one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945412
    m_Localized: I marked our place. We will not lose the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945413
    m_Localized: Good. I sometimes forget how far we have come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945414
    m_Localized: The snow is deep, but this board is clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945415
    m_Localized: One dry place for my paws. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945416
    m_Localized: My ears caught a breeze. We will wait until you are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945417
    m_Localized: Almost ready. I am checking the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945418
    m_Localized: I used to count these steps with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945419
    m_Localized: Now we can count the lights instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945420
    m_Localized: No need to hurry, little one. I am right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945421
    m_Localized: Then I will do this last part carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945422
    m_Localized: 'Our next job: {0}. Ready when you are.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 593227919908864
    m_Localized: Let us do this together. Then we can carry on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 599985858011136
    m_Localized: Wind is coming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 599985862205440
    m_Localized: The wind moved the row
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 600492383133696
    m_Localized: Wind moves the whole row one place on landing. Watch this example
      before going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650634661888
    m_Localized: Frost flask
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856192
    m_Localized: Match the flask picture. The bomb waits two swaps. The wood still
      wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856193
    m_Localized: Move the pictured piece above the frost flask. The bomb waits for
      two swaps, including this one. The wood still wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856194
    m_Localized: Match the flask picture. The bomb waits for two swaps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856195
    m_Localized: Bomb cooled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 613809549991936
    m_Localized: Tools and trophies for the journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 613809554186240
    m_Localized: Practice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232689020928
    m_Localized: '{0} coins added'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186752
    m_Localized: Back to shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186753
    m_Localized: A trophy or a few tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186754
    m_Localized: More for your collection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186755
    m_Localized: Try +{0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186756
    m_Localized: You have enough coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186757
    m_Localized: Two tools used. Try the next step yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186758
    m_Localized: Two tools per stage. With help, earn up to two stars. Five stars
      are yours to earn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186759
    m_Localized: Test shop. No money is charged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186760
    m_Localized: Coins are optional. Earn them by playing, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186761
    m_Localized: Advertising privacy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963959300096
    m_Localized: Tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494400
    m_Localized: Up to 2 tools per stage. Tools cap this run at 2 stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494401
    m_Localized: "Test shop \xB7 no charge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494402
    m_Localized: The store could not finish. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494403
    m_Localized: The shop is not open yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494404
    m_Localized: Coins can also be earned by playing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947791122432
    m_Localized: Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316736
    m_Localized: Field guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316737
    m_Localized: Watch an example, then try it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316738
    m_Localized: Always with you. Free to read.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316739
    m_Localized: Open guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676262187098112
    m_Localized: Try it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676262241624064
    m_Localized: Opens at level {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676262241624065
    m_Localized: Fewer moves, more stars. Replay a level to improve your score.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689485263134720
    m_Localized: Strong gust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689485288300544
    m_Localized: After your next swap, wind shifts the row. It can crack the board.
      Plan your move, or descend before the gust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689485288300545
    m_Localized: 'Next swap: a strong gust. You can descend first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647616
    m_Localized: A light to carry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647617
    m_Localized: The storm took our island lights. I will be waiting at the Great
      Beacon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647618
    m_Localized: I will bring our little light to you. I just wish the bridges were
      lower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647619
    m_Localized: The broken way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647620
    m_Localized: I built these bridges. Seeing them broken feels like losing old
      friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647621
    m_Localized: Then we will give them new boards. Will you stay while I cross?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647622
    m_Localized: A builder's promise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647623
    m_Localized: Bram. Builder, bread lover, and your first travelling friend. I
      will stay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647624
    m_Localized: One bridge first. The beacon can wait for one careful step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647625
    m_Localized: The quiet wheel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647626
    m_Localized: Pip's mill used to sing all day. Now the buckets come back empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647627
    m_Localized: I can hear the rain. I cannot hear the water reaching the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647628
    m_Localized: Too fast to listen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647629
    m_Localized: I tried turning everything at once. My little brother got the biggest
      splash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647630
    m_Localized: He is still here with his bucket. He believes you will mend it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647631
    m_Localized: Water for everyone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647632
    m_Localized: I want to deserve that. Help me start with one wheel, Mika.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647633
    m_Localized: One wheel, then one well. We will listen as we go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647634
    m_Localized: An orchard without lanterns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647635
    m_Localized: Without Rue's lantern fruit, the birds circle past their own nests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647636
    m_Localized: A home should be easy to find. Let us give them a light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647637
    m_Localized: Seeds for tomorrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647638
    m_Localized: I saved the seeds before the fruit. Tomorrow needs a little care
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647639
    m_Localized: Can I carry a few? My pocket has room beside Gran's letter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647640
    m_Localized: The first branch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647641
    m_Localized: Keep them warm. We will wake one tree and let the birds guide us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647642
    m_Localized: Small things can show a very long way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647643
    m_Localized: Letters in the clouds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841920
    m_Localized: Sora knows every sky route. The storm scattered the letters across
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841921
    m_Localized: There is a letter for Gran somewhere up there. We will find it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841922
    m_Localized: The letter not sent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841923
    m_Localized: I deliver everybody's letters. My own has waited in my pocket for
      months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841924
    m_Localized: Maybe you can write it while I mend the post bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841925
    m_Localized: A route between friends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841926
    m_Localized: First we get these letters home. Then I will find my first sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841927
    m_Localized: You could start with what you miss. That is how I started Gran's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841928
    m_Localized: No light on the shore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841929
    m_Localized: The lagoon still shines like glass, but Neri's boats cannot find
      the shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841930
    m_Localized: Deep water makes my paws shake. I can still help from the pier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841931
    m_Localized: The first little boat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841932
    m_Localized: My mother helped me fold this boat. I promised to keep its route
      open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841933
    m_Localized: Let us start with the nearest lamp. I can reach that one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841934
    m_Localized: A safe place to land
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841935
    m_Localized: You do not have to become brave all at once. I will hold the boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841936
    m_Localized: And I will make the first landing safe for both of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841937
    m_Localized: Rain between the shelves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841938
    m_Localized: Toma keeps every island map in the Moss Archive. Rain has found
      a way in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841939
    m_Localized: We need the road through the snow. We can mend the roof on our way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841940
    m_Localized: A map kept safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841941
    m_Localized: That map is the last copy. If you take it, what will stay on my
      shelf?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841942
    m_Localized: A space for the story we bring back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841943
    m_Localized: A map put to use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841944
    m_Localized: A road belongs under someone's paws. I will help you read it, Mika.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841945
    m_Localized: Then the archive is coming with us, one page at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841946
    m_Localized: The road disappears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841947
    m_Localized: Snow covered the warm trail lamps. Even Lumi cannot see the next
      ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841948
    m_Localized: I thought guides always knew the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841949
    m_Localized: A guide needs company
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841950
    m_Localized: I know this mountain. I do not know every snowflake. Stay close
      today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841951
    m_Localized: We can share my lantern. Gran's scarf is long enough for two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841952
    m_Localized: One warm footprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841953
    m_Localized: First we wake the steps. Then the mountain will show us its shape
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841954
    m_Localized: And if it does not, we will wait together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841955
    m_Localized: A window still glowing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841956
    m_Localized: Gran kept a lamp in her window while the Great Beacon was dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841957
    m_Localized: I saw it from the snow road. You knew I would come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841958
    m_Localized: Stories at the door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841959
    m_Localized: I hoped you would. Come warm your paws and tell me who helped you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841960
    m_Localized: So many friends. I brought a little piece of every island home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841961
    m_Localized: Two keepers, one light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841962
    m_Localized: My knees dislike these stairs now. Will you carry the light beside
      me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841963
    m_Localized: I will, Gran. Let us make a light our friends can see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841964
    m_Localized: Above the beacon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841965
    m_Localized: The beacon is shining. Above its clouds, the star routes are still
      dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841966
    m_Localized: Aster watches there. After breakfast, you could take him a light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841967
    m_Localized: An imperfect chart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841968
    m_Localized: I am Aster. My charts lost some stars. I have been trying to fix
      them alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841969
    m_Localized: There is room for two by your telescope. May I look with you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841970
    m_Localized: A path for night travellers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841971
    m_Localized: The chart is not perfect yet. But perhaps we can start with the
      moon dial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841972
    m_Localized: We do not need every star to take the first step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841973
    m_Localized: My first bridge has lost its boards. I kept the good timber.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841974
    m_Localized: You bring the boards, Bram. I will bring the light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841975
    m_Localized: The wind gate creaks like my old knees. It needs a careful hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841976
    m_Localized: I will keep my scarf clear of the hinges this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841977
    m_Localized: I checked the sky lift twice. I still worry when someone climbs
      aboard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841978
    m_Localized: Let us mend it, then check it together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841979
    m_Localized: The market baker saved us a loaf. Her lamps need saving too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841980
    m_Localized: Warm bread and a bright doorway. That sounds like a good job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841981
    m_Localized: This last bridge leads to Pip. I have not crossed it since the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841982
    m_Localized: When it is safe, you could walk the first part with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841983
    m_Localized: The wheel needs a steady start. My paws always want to rush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841984
    m_Localized: We can go slowly enough to hear it catch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841985
    m_Localized: The village pipe is blocked. My brother put his bucket at the far
      end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841986
    m_Localized: Let us bring the water all the way to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841987
    m_Localized: These wells serve the smallest houses. They should not have to wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841988
    m_Localized: Small houses need full buckets too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841989
    m_Localized: I promised Sora a post boat. A promise is heavier than a bucket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841990
    m_Localized: Good thing we have two pairs of paws to carry it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841991
    m_Localized: Rue is waiting beyond this gate. She traded us seeds for a cup of
      water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841992
    m_Localized: Then this path is our way of saying thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841993
    m_Localized: The birds keep circling this tree. They remember its light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841994
    m_Localized: We will help the tree remember too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841995
    m_Localized: I made the branch bridge narrow to spare the roots. Now it needs
      mending.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841996
    m_Localized: We can look after the roots and the travellers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841997
    m_Localized: The village needs this jam. I would rather share it than keep it
      safe here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841998
    m_Localized: First the path, then a jar for every table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841999
    m_Localized: The seed house is cold. These tiny things are next year's orchard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842000
    m_Localized: Let us make a warm place for things we cannot see yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842001
    m_Localized: Sora used to bring letters through this gate. I miss her noisy landings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842002
    m_Localized: We will open it. You can put the kettle on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842003
    m_Localized: Every scattered letter belongs to someone waiting. I keep thinking
      of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842004
    m_Localized: Let us gather them one safe landing at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842005
    m_Localized: Gran's letter is small, but you have carried it such a long way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842006
    m_Localized: I want her to know I am coming. Can we send it from here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842007
    m_Localized: Without this bridge, I can reach the clouds but not the post house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842008
    m_Localized: Even a flyer needs somewhere steady to land.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842009
    m_Localized: The mail basket is heavy. I tucked my unfinished letter underneath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842010
    m_Localized: We can lift the basket. You can finish one sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842011
    m_Localized: Neri's shore is below this last gate. I owe her a visit, not just
      a letter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842012
    m_Localized: Come with me after we open it. She might have tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842013
    m_Localized: The pier is cracked. I promised you a dry place to stand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842014
    m_Localized: We can make one. I will start close to the shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842015
    m_Localized: Each pond lamp marks a turn. My mother's boat knew them all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842016
    m_Localized: Tell me the turns as we bring their lights back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842017
    m_Localized: The water gate holds my smallest boats outside. I hear their sails
      tapping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842018
    m_Localized: We will open their way home, carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842019
    m_Localized: This pond light has travelled for years. Now it needs someone to
      carry it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842020
    m_Localized: I can carry it beside mine. They will keep each other company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842021
    m_Localized: Toma keeps the snow map beyond this path. He dislikes lending precious
      things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842022
    m_Localized: I will tell him what a careful boat maker taught me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842023
    m_Localized: The leaf door jammed in the rain. Please mind the oldest maps inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842024
    m_Localized: I will wipe my paws before I touch a page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842025
    m_Localized: These shelves move together. I tied them to keep the books from
      falling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842026
    m_Localized: We can untie the road without losing a book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842027
    m_Localized: The storm map is behind this case. I have never let it travel before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842028
    m_Localized: Maybe it has been waiting for a journey too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842029
    m_Localized: Rain is reaching the ink. I cannot hold the roof and the page together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842030
    m_Localized: You hold the roof. My scarf will look after the page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842031
    m_Localized: Gran left this note between two maps. I saved it for when you were
      ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842032
    m_Localized: Let us open the way to it. I think I am ready now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842033
    m_Localized: The snow steps are hidden. I remember where their lamps belong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842034
    m_Localized: You remember the places. I will bring the light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842035
    m_Localized: I built this shelter for others. Today I need its warmth too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842036
    m_Localized: Then we mend it for both of us, and have a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842037
    m_Localized: The frozen arch hides its far side. I do not like that either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842038
    m_Localized: We can plan the landing together before we cross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842039
    m_Localized: Pip sent a blanket for you. He asked me to carry it carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842040
    m_Localized: There is room for your paws under it too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842041
    m_Localized: The beacon road starts here. I can see one window through the snow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842042
    m_Localized: That is Gran's lamp. Let us give her a whole road of lights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842043
    m_Localized: This last bridge used to feel enormous to you. I left its lamp burning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842044
    m_Localized: It still feels enormous. But I know how to mend a bridge now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842045
    m_Localized: The lantern lift has waited all storm. I could not mend it alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842046
    m_Localized: You waited for me. Now we have enough paws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842047
    m_Localized: I used to carry you up these stairs. Today we will climb side by
      side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842048
    m_Localized: I can hold the lantern so you can hold the rail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842049
    m_Localized: The sky lantern needs both our lights. Mine is small, but I kept
      it safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842050
    m_Localized: Mine came through every island. Let us lift them together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842051
    m_Localized: The beacon lens is ready. Would you like to light it, keeper Mika?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842052
    m_Localized: Yes. So everyone who helped us can find the way home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842053
    m_Localized: The moon dial lost its rhythm. I counted alone until sunrise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842054
    m_Localized: We can count together. You can close one tired eye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842055
    m_Localized: My telescope bridge is missing a board. I kept observing from the
      doorstep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842056
    m_Localized: Let us mend it. The stars deserve a closer look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842057
    m_Localized: The star charts blew apart. I was waiting to find every corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842058
    m_Localized: We can start with the pieces we have, Aster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842059
    m_Localized: These constellation lamps once guided the night gliders. I miss
      their wings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842060
    m_Localized: Let us give the first glider a pattern to follow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842061
    m_Localized: The last sky gate is ahead. I would like someone else to check my
      chart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842062
    m_Localized: I will check it with you. Then we can wave to the travellers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842063
    m_Localized: Star Observatory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842064
    m_Localized: Aster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842065
    m_Localized: I am Aster. The constellations went dark. I know the sky, but I
      need another pair of eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842066
    m_Localized: Gran's beacon is shining. Let us help its light reach the night
      travellers too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842067
    m_Localized: Wake the moon dial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842068
    m_Localized: Mend the telescope bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842069
    m_Localized: Gather the scattered star charts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842070
    m_Localized: Relight the constellations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842071
    m_Localized: Open the night travellers' route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842072
    m_Localized: The moon dial is keeping time again. I can hear its quiet tick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842073
    m_Localized: It sounds like Pip's mill, but sleepy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842074
    m_Localized: The telescope bridge is steady. There is room for two observers
      now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842075
    m_Localized: Your stars look closer when you share them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842076
    m_Localized: The charts have gaps, but their routes join. I was waiting for too
      much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842077
    m_Localized: We found enough sky to keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842078
    m_Localized: The constellations are bright. That glider knows where to turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842079
    m_Localized: Look, Aster. Someone is waving from its window!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842080
    m_Localized: The sky gate is open. Tonight I will leave a second stool by the
      telescope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842081
    m_Localized: Save it for me. I will bring Gran and a flask of warm tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842082
    m_Localized: I mistook a firefly for a star once. I wrote it down very carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842083
    m_Localized: Maybe it was your nearest star that night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842084
    m_Localized: The clearest sky still has clouds. I am learning to look between
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842085
    m_Localized: There is room for our next step between these boards too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842086
    m_Localized: The beacon is bright, but the sky paths are still dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842087
    m_Localized: Aster has been waiting above the clouds. Tonight we will help him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842088
    m_Localized: The moon dial is turning. Its light reaches a tiny telescope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842089
    m_Localized: Aster says he used to watch alone. I will watch with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842090
    m_Localized: These star charts blew out of Aster's notebook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842091
    m_Localized: Some corners are missing. There is still enough to find the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842092
    m_Localized: One constellation is awake. I can see the next in its light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842093
    m_Localized: The stars are far apart. Their pattern brings them together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842094
    m_Localized: A little glider is following our new sky path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842095
    m_Localized: Gran's beacon and Aster's stars are shining together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842096
    m_Localized: I thought I had to mend every bridge before I could cross one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842097
    m_Localized: You crossed the first part with me. That was enough for today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842098
    m_Localized: My brother filled his bucket himself. He asked when you are coming
      for tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842099
    m_Localized: After the post boat is ready. We have a promise to carry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842100
    m_Localized: You still have those seeds. I thought you might have forgotten them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842101
    m_Localized: They are warm beside the letter. I want to show Gran tomorrow's
      orchard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842102
    m_Localized: 'I wrote the first sentence: I miss having tea with you. It was
      easier than I feared.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842103
    m_Localized: Then the next sentence can wait until we lift this basket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842104
    m_Localized: The little boat reached its lamp. My mother would have liked your
      careful landing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842105
    m_Localized: I was still scared. You made room for that too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036224
    m_Localized: There is an empty space on my shelf now. It feels like an open door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036225
    m_Localized: Keep it for us. I will bring the map back with a story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036226
    m_Localized: I usually tell travellers to stay close. Today I am glad you told
      me too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036227
    m_Localized: Guides can share blankets. Pip sent a very big one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036228
    m_Localized: You ask for help sooner now. That is something a keeper needs to
      learn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036229
    m_Localized: I learnt it from a whole sky of friends. And you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036230
    m_Localized: I left the unfinished chart on the table. Someone added a star while
      we worked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036231
    m_Localized: Maybe another observer wanted a place beside you too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036232
    m_Localized: Finish current level first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036233
    m_Localized: Finish your current level before starting a stamp trail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036234
    m_Localized: Light the constellations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036235
    m_Localized: '{0}: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036236
    m_Localized: The sky shines again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036237
    m_Localized: A light for every traveller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036238
    m_Localized: Mika brought the light home. Together, her friends lit the way beyond
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
